WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.360 --> 01:35.130
[Romance on the Farm]

01:35.800 --> 01:37.920
[Episode 4]

01:54.660 --> 01:55.259
Aunt He.

01:57.100 --> 01:57.820
Aunt He.

01:59.020 --> 02:00.820
Aunt He. Aunt He.

02:01.170 --> 02:02.130
Aunt He.

02:05.980 --> 02:06.540
Have some chicken.

02:08.220 --> 02:08.699
Where is it?

02:09.100 --> 02:09.979
Where is it?

02:10.580 --> 02:11.220
Aunt He.

02:11.380 --> 02:12.450
Grandpa is borrowing money.

02:12.470 --> 02:13.190
Don't you want to go and take a look?

02:14.940 --> 02:16.260
What's there to see?

02:16.660 --> 02:18.340
He is not borrowing money for me.

02:19.860 --> 02:21.700
Aunt He, listen to me.

02:22.530 --> 02:23.370
After Grandpa agreed

02:23.390 --> 02:24.560
to borrow money from Mr. Jin yesterday,

02:25.380 --> 02:26.780
I tossed and turned all night.

02:26.990 --> 02:27.780
I was thinking

02:28.140 --> 02:29.970
that if Lian Hua'er marries into the Song family,

02:30.329 --> 02:31.570
will she become a member of the Song family?

02:32.100 --> 02:33.060
Of course.

02:33.420 --> 02:35.540
But it's Grandpa who's putting his fingerprint

02:35.800 --> 02:37.310
on the IOU.

02:39.470 --> 02:40.310
The Song family wants to borrow money.

02:40.970 --> 02:41.720
The Lian family's fingerprint is on the IOU.

02:42.550 --> 02:43.790
Aunt He, do you feel secure?

02:44.240 --> 02:44.980
Yes.

02:46.930 --> 02:48.350
Or no?

02:49.220 --> 02:50.940
What do you mean?

02:51.230 --> 02:51.950
I mean

02:53.110 --> 02:54.079
on the IOU,

02:54.100 --> 02:55.450
it'll be the Lian family's fingerprint.

02:56.270 --> 02:57.180
If in the future,

02:57.200 --> 02:58.600
Hua'er says she's from the Song family

02:58.960 --> 02:59.579
and has no reason

02:59.579 --> 03:00.940
to repay the money for the Lian family,

03:01.240 --> 03:02.800
should we repay the money ourselves?

03:05.200 --> 03:06.600
If Mr. Jin comes to collect the debts,

03:07.060 --> 03:08.980
our house and land

03:09.050 --> 03:09.930
are all here.

03:10.040 --> 03:11.990
We can't run away.

03:14.660 --> 03:15.260
Mr. Lian.

03:15.670 --> 03:17.140
If there's nothing wrong,

03:17.270 --> 03:18.430
you can sign and put your fingerprint here.

03:18.740 --> 03:20.230
Then Scholar and I

03:20.420 --> 03:21.060
will go and get the money.

03:21.560 --> 03:22.640
There's nothing wrong.

03:22.980 --> 03:23.780
My father knows

03:24.050 --> 03:25.160
what kind of person you are.

03:26.050 --> 03:26.540
Of course.

03:30.690 --> 03:31.820
I'll warn Grandpa right away.

03:32.190 --> 03:33.260
Will you help me?

03:34.300 --> 03:35.220
I'll go now.

03:43.460 --> 03:44.060
Wait.

03:46.340 --> 03:46.820
Father.

03:47.310 --> 03:48.780
The fingerprint on the IOU

03:49.100 --> 03:50.500
must be given by Hua'er.

03:53.290 --> 03:54.160
Hua'er

03:54.300 --> 03:56.160
is still unmarried.

03:56.420 --> 03:57.980
She can't do such a thing.

03:58.140 --> 03:59.820
The fingerprint should be Father's.

04:00.260 --> 04:02.060
Father is the head of the family.

04:02.580 --> 04:04.800
That makes sense.

04:05.140 --> 04:06.030
But

04:06.220 --> 04:07.450
you can't say that.

04:08.180 --> 04:10.180
Gu.

04:10.210 --> 04:11.490
Better safe than sorry.

04:12.150 --> 04:14.430
The words of Hua'er sound nice,

04:14.820 --> 04:16.579
but if she can't repay the money in the future,

04:17.350 --> 04:18.200
the land and house of the Lian family

04:18.230 --> 04:20.350
will be used to pay off the debts.

04:20.370 --> 04:21.339
How will we

04:21.339 --> 04:23.090
live then?

04:23.130 --> 04:24.070
How will we live?

04:25.490 --> 04:27.810
Elders protect children.

04:27.950 --> 04:29.570
It's natural.

04:30.020 --> 04:30.770
But in the Lian family,

04:31.020 --> 04:32.900
Hua'er is not the only daughter.

04:33.460 --> 04:35.200
I have Ye'er and Jizu.

04:35.250 --> 04:36.700
And Jizu.

04:37.950 --> 04:39.020
Lian Hua'er

04:39.050 --> 04:40.590
is just a girl.

04:40.820 --> 04:42.409
Jizu is a boy.

04:43.220 --> 04:44.870
In the future, he'll rely on the money of the family

04:44.900 --> 04:46.290
to study and get married.

04:46.820 --> 04:47.700
The fingerprint

04:48.100 --> 04:48.980
must be given by Hua'er.

04:52.870 --> 04:53.780
Aunt He.

04:54.590 --> 04:56.360
The money is borrowed for me.

04:56.780 --> 04:58.659
I'll definitely pay it back.

04:59.540 --> 05:00.780
Fine. You'll pay it back.

05:00.810 --> 05:01.410
Come here. Press your finger.

05:01.900 --> 05:02.460
Lian Man'er.

05:03.900 --> 05:04.820
Your elders are here.

05:05.460 --> 05:06.650
How dare you interrupt?

05:08.100 --> 05:08.460
Shouxin.

05:08.820 --> 05:09.780
Why don't you discipline

05:09.780 --> 05:10.580
Man'er?

05:11.380 --> 05:12.900
She's getting more and more disrespectful.

05:15.700 --> 05:16.260
Man'er.

05:17.380 --> 05:19.140
Let your grandpa make a decision.

05:20.820 --> 05:21.900
Hua'er

05:22.220 --> 05:23.780
won't welsh.

05:24.340 --> 05:24.970
Besides,

05:25.340 --> 05:27.780
Father is still here.

05:28.200 --> 05:29.340
How can his granddaughter be in charge

05:29.340 --> 05:30.550
and borrow money?

05:30.810 --> 05:31.750
If word gets out

05:31.780 --> 05:32.820
and others know it,

05:33.460 --> 05:34.010
what will they

05:34.340 --> 05:35.900
think of our family in the future?

05:36.030 --> 05:37.680
Mr. Jin is not a big mouth.

05:38.020 --> 05:39.100
If the Lian family don't tell others,

05:39.190 --> 05:39.909
who will know it?

05:40.090 --> 05:40.980
Shut up!

05:43.140 --> 05:45.020
The eldest young master of the Lian family is so powerful.

05:46.380 --> 05:47.780
It seems that the head of the Lian family

05:48.600 --> 05:49.720
is your eldest son.

05:52.020 --> 05:53.220
I'm not dead yet.

05:53.780 --> 05:54.260
Father.

05:54.950 --> 05:56.400
That's not what I meant.

06:03.590 --> 06:04.080
Father.

06:05.460 --> 06:06.280
How about

06:06.670 --> 06:08.150
we discuss it again?

06:09.900 --> 06:10.660
Scholar.

06:11.100 --> 06:12.790
We made an agreement before.

06:13.100 --> 06:14.780
You asked me to prepare an IOU

06:14.780 --> 06:15.340
and bring it here.

06:15.660 --> 06:16.700
But now you...

06:16.900 --> 06:17.540
Your family

06:17.540 --> 06:18.580
want to discuss it again.

06:19.620 --> 06:20.380
I'm not

06:20.380 --> 06:21.260
bragging.

06:21.470 --> 06:22.920
There are tons of people

06:23.230 --> 06:25.110
who want to borrow money from our private bank.

06:25.610 --> 06:26.630
500 taels of silver.

06:27.160 --> 06:28.830
There is a lot of interest every day.

06:29.220 --> 06:30.580
If you're not sincere,

06:31.030 --> 06:31.920
don't get in the way of me making money.

06:35.220 --> 06:36.580
Father. Grandpa.

06:44.520 --> 06:45.260
I'll give my fingerprint.

07:23.610 --> 07:25.600
The problem of the forced marriage was finally solved.

07:26.140 --> 07:27.710
No one will harass me anymore.

07:28.010 --> 07:28.450
Right?

07:31.330 --> 07:33.280
I gotta think of a way to make money.

07:33.700 --> 07:35.540
This place is good, but I can't stay here for long.

07:36.460 --> 07:36.980
Yellow.

07:37.220 --> 07:37.940
Do you think

07:37.980 --> 07:38.900
I can make 1,000 taels of gold?

07:39.900 --> 07:40.250
Yes.

07:41.040 --> 07:41.800
Yes. Yes.

07:42.630 --> 07:44.320
I'm relieved to hear that.

07:50.830 --> 07:51.140
Let's go.

08:16.060 --> 08:17.230
I know

08:17.600 --> 08:18.540
making money from firethorns

08:18.560 --> 08:19.550
is too slow.

08:20.140 --> 08:21.580
But this is just a stopgap measure.

08:22.000 --> 08:23.020
I've done some research.

08:23.390 --> 08:25.300
Lipstick, rouge, and pork offal

08:25.580 --> 08:26.580
are being sold by other people.

08:27.110 --> 08:28.430
And you're overqualified

08:28.460 --> 08:29.580
for manual jobs.

08:33.190 --> 08:33.860
So,

08:34.700 --> 08:35.820
how about writing letters for people?

08:36.110 --> 08:37.460
This job is suitable for you.

08:37.880 --> 08:39.059
Besides, the market lacks you...

08:39.080 --> 08:40.090
Don't bother.

08:44.520 --> 08:47.170
Don't refuse immediately.

08:47.580 --> 08:48.330
I've thought about it.

08:48.580 --> 08:50.070
This business doesn't require capital

08:50.100 --> 08:51.220
and technical proficiency.

08:51.820 --> 08:52.340
You

08:52.710 --> 08:53.970
just need to sit there.

08:54.390 --> 08:55.520
With your handsome face,

08:55.890 --> 08:56.890
girls

08:56.910 --> 08:57.750
will rush to spend money for you.

09:01.270 --> 09:02.230
I don't mean to say

09:02.260 --> 09:03.060
that you're a toy boy.

09:03.540 --> 09:04.400
I mean

09:04.760 --> 09:05.920
God already put the food

09:05.940 --> 09:06.810
in your mouth.

09:06.980 --> 09:08.700
It's impolite to not eat it.

09:10.420 --> 09:11.010
Besides,

09:11.460 --> 09:12.980
you still owe me 100 taels of silver.

09:13.400 --> 09:15.390
It's only right to pay off your debts.

09:22.400 --> 09:23.420
Except writing letters for people,

09:24.040 --> 09:24.980
I can consider other jobs.

09:29.820 --> 09:31.820
Fine. Tell me

09:32.000 --> 09:32.740
what you can do.

09:33.390 --> 09:34.540
You don't want to use your brain

09:34.890 --> 09:35.830
and take advantage of your face.

09:36.260 --> 09:37.550
It takes you too long to pick firethorns.

09:37.580 --> 09:38.500
Even Seven is more capable than you.

09:39.860 --> 09:40.690
The sun is setting.

09:41.310 --> 09:42.350
If you can't fill the basket with firethorns,

09:42.460 --> 09:43.130
don't go back.

09:57.330 --> 09:57.770
Seven.

10:02.700 --> 10:03.780
Amazing!

10:03.810 --> 10:05.290
Shen Nuo is amazing.

10:08.710 --> 10:10.730
It was filled up so soon. Let's go.

10:10.840 --> 10:11.730
Let's go home.

10:18.100 --> 10:25.810
♫Not bad♫

10:26.250 --> 10:28.330
♫This appearance♫

10:28.460 --> 10:36.980
♫I often think about it in the daytime and see it in my dreams♫

10:37.130 --> 10:43.010
♫Was it arranged 500 years ago?♫

10:43.620 --> 10:51.110
♫This body should belong to him♫

10:56.740 --> 10:59.190
♫Someone is knocking on the door♫

10:59.760 --> 11:01.550
♫Judging by the sound♫

11:01.580 --> 11:03.420
♫It's a woman♫

11:03.580 --> 11:06.700
♫It's not a robber♫

11:07.120 --> 11:11.120
♫Let me open the door♫

11:12.450 --> 11:13.340
Bravo! Bravo!

11:13.500 --> 11:15.060
Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!

11:15.500 --> 11:19.660
♫Not bad♫

11:20.410 --> 11:22.140
♫This appearance♫

11:22.340 --> 11:30.340
♫I often think about it in the daytime and see it in my dreams♫

11:30.340 --> 11:30.820
Thirteen.

11:32.100 --> 11:32.580
Thirteen.

11:33.510 --> 11:35.060
Come out quickly after you get the stuff.

12:13.510 --> 12:14.100
Thirteen.

12:14.410 --> 12:15.100
Young Master.

12:15.190 --> 12:15.550
You...

12:19.670 --> 12:20.340
Young Master.

12:22.570 --> 12:23.700
Why are you dressed like this?

12:24.210 --> 12:25.730
I'm going to perform on the stage.

12:26.500 --> 12:27.010
Perform?

12:27.500 --> 12:28.180
Aren't you being kidnapped

12:28.180 --> 12:28.980
and in danger?

12:29.100 --> 12:29.860
I'm being kidnapped.

12:29.880 --> 12:30.920
I'm being kidnapped.

12:31.220 --> 12:32.340
The troupe

12:32.360 --> 12:33.610
needs more people on the stage tonight.

12:37.170 --> 12:37.940
Do you know the identities of the members

12:37.980 --> 12:39.060
of the troupe downstairs?

12:40.330 --> 12:41.340
On the surface,

12:41.820 --> 12:42.960
they're just a group of people

12:42.990 --> 12:43.590
who perform from village to village.

12:44.440 --> 12:46.320
But they're skilled in martial arts.

12:46.720 --> 12:48.230
After I made an appointment with you that day,

12:48.340 --> 12:49.220
I came here first.

12:49.550 --> 12:50.790
I happened to see them

12:50.820 --> 12:51.610
occupy Carters' Inn

12:51.880 --> 12:53.360
and make it a temporary place for entertainment.

12:54.070 --> 12:55.170
When I was waiting for you,

12:55.300 --> 12:56.260
the leader of the troupe

12:56.280 --> 12:57.160
kept me here for no reason.

12:57.900 --> 12:59.150
What took you so long?

13:01.250 --> 13:02.370
I was shot by a poison arrow.

13:02.720 --> 13:03.960
People from the government also saw my face.

13:04.460 --> 13:05.390
At that time, they were sending more people

13:05.420 --> 13:06.340
to look for me.

13:06.640 --> 13:07.510
For the moment, I can only

13:07.700 --> 13:09.040
live in a farmer's house.

13:09.080 --> 13:10.160
Are you safe there?

13:10.700 --> 13:11.340
All right.

13:11.500 --> 13:12.860
Don't worry. There's no problem.

13:13.340 --> 13:14.620
I've talked to that family.

13:15.720 --> 13:16.150
Currently,

13:16.180 --> 13:17.340
I'm their distant nephew.

13:17.940 --> 13:19.060
I work for them every day.

13:19.340 --> 13:20.180
Even if someone investigates me,

13:20.390 --> 13:21.180
that family

13:21.420 --> 13:22.460
will cover for me.

13:23.300 --> 13:24.620
When I came to see you last time,

13:25.120 --> 13:25.820
I saw people who guarded you

13:25.820 --> 13:26.820
were all good at martial artists.

13:27.740 --> 13:28.700
My injuries were not healed

13:28.720 --> 13:29.440
at that time.

13:29.860 --> 13:31.060
I had no choice but to leave first.

13:31.870 --> 13:32.940
But with your martial art skills,

13:33.220 --> 13:34.420
why didn't you find a chance to escape?

13:35.460 --> 13:36.460
Because I found...

13:44.110 --> 13:45.810
Are you acting a play

13:45.810 --> 13:47.270
about good brothers who never abandon each other?

13:50.360 --> 13:53.640
This young man is so handsome.

13:54.620 --> 13:55.300
How about

13:55.940 --> 13:57.500
you stay in our Shengde Troupe?

14:10.180 --> 14:12.100
Champion, please take the whip.

14:17.100 --> 14:18.460
It depends on whether you can keep me.

14:19.100 --> 14:19.580
Go!

14:32.500 --> 14:36.100
I don't need a consort.

14:53.980 --> 15:06.980
Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!

15:07.000 --> 15:09.040
Don't stop clapping.

15:09.690 --> 15:13.250
Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!

15:41.410 --> 15:42.070
It's him.

15:42.270 --> 15:43.340
I saw him kill Young Master Sun

15:43.340 --> 15:44.340
with my own eyes.

15:48.200 --> 15:50.300
[A Friend of Sun Li, Fan Lin]

15:50.220 --> 15:53.500
Bravo!

15:57.180 --> 16:00.980
Bravo!

16:09.230 --> 16:11.270
Don't run. You haven't paid yet.

16:11.600 --> 16:12.450
Pay up.

16:15.340 --> 16:16.100
Pay up.

16:31.320 --> 16:32.810
If you want someone, just say it.

16:33.470 --> 16:34.990
Why are you playing hard to get?

16:35.310 --> 16:36.950
You're quite hard to deal with.

16:37.970 --> 16:39.840
You have swords and knives.

16:40.300 --> 16:41.860
It's impossible to escape from here.

16:45.740 --> 16:46.980
You're speaking slang.

16:47.700 --> 16:49.280
Are you from the martial arts world?

16:49.300 --> 16:50.620
I just have the same interest.

16:51.650 --> 16:52.700
Since we met,

16:54.030 --> 16:54.920
why don't you tell me your name?

16:54.950 --> 16:56.190
We came here to perform

16:56.210 --> 16:57.290
and make some money.

16:57.660 --> 16:58.990
My surname

16:59.190 --> 17:00.910
is Yu.

16:59.470 --> 17:00.710
[Yu Xiangjin]

17:02.110 --> 17:03.700
Look at you.

17:03.850 --> 17:05.530
I didn't expect you to have the same interest as us.

17:08.349 --> 17:09.300
My friend

17:09.569 --> 17:10.849
was kept here by you.

17:11.819 --> 17:12.890
He must have offended you.

17:15.260 --> 17:16.260
I apologize.

17:17.720 --> 17:18.880
May I ask

17:19.280 --> 17:20.020
why you kept him here?

17:25.260 --> 17:27.180
You friend doesn't know rules.

17:27.609 --> 17:28.790
He sat on my suitcase.

17:29.860 --> 17:31.110
As a man,

17:31.310 --> 17:32.820
he sat on the items I used for making money.

17:33.280 --> 17:34.290
Bad luck.

17:35.620 --> 17:36.390
That's true.

17:37.800 --> 17:39.060
How about you name your price

17:39.820 --> 17:41.650
and give me a chance to make friends with you?

17:42.260 --> 17:43.140
We both know

17:43.660 --> 17:44.700
that only you can decide

17:44.700 --> 17:46.180
whether my friend can be released.

17:46.630 --> 17:47.110
OK.

17:49.180 --> 17:50.740
The loss of tonight's performance

17:50.930 --> 17:52.600
and the fact that your friend offended me.

17:53.460 --> 17:54.260
200 taels of silver.

17:54.590 --> 17:55.860
You're asking too much.

17:55.880 --> 17:57.530
You're breaking the rules of the martial arts world.

17:57.640 --> 17:58.490
Shut up!

17:59.020 --> 17:59.740
Rules?

18:00.210 --> 18:01.340
I'm the rule.

18:03.530 --> 18:04.260
200 taels of silver.

18:08.890 --> 18:10.410
It’s really difficult.

18:11.170 --> 18:12.060
It seems

18:12.420 --> 18:13.780
that I can only leave my friend here.

18:14.610 --> 18:15.120
Goodbye.

18:16.360 --> 18:17.130
100 taels of silver.

18:20.220 --> 18:21.220
50 taels of silver.

18:25.410 --> 18:26.540
200 taels of silver is fine.

18:26.920 --> 18:27.640
In a month,

18:28.060 --> 18:29.210
I'll ransom him.

18:30.730 --> 18:31.990
How dare you trick me?

18:34.310 --> 18:35.980
Don't you like

18:36.160 --> 18:37.530
playing tricks?

18:41.320 --> 18:42.450
Please

18:42.820 --> 18:43.620
take good care of

18:43.620 --> 18:44.620
my friend.

18:46.220 --> 18:47.030
Before I leave,

18:47.150 --> 18:48.180
I have something

18:48.380 --> 18:49.260
to tell him.

18:49.750 --> 18:50.330
I wonder...

19:00.770 --> 19:01.210
Thank you.

19:07.050 --> 19:07.740
Are you okay?

19:08.060 --> 19:08.540
I'm fine.

19:08.790 --> 19:09.370
Let me ask you.

19:10.140 --> 19:10.660
Why did the rich man

19:10.660 --> 19:11.740
we had our eyes on before

19:12.380 --> 19:13.390
suddenly appear

19:13.420 --> 19:14.060
in Carters' Inn?

19:14.540 --> 19:15.980
I didn't have time to elaborate.

19:16.720 --> 19:17.620
I caught that man

19:17.800 --> 19:19.160
drinking and enjoying opera here.

19:19.950 --> 19:21.100
So I took this opportunity

19:21.140 --> 19:22.180
to fish for information.

19:22.660 --> 19:24.560
I heard from the troupe by chance

19:25.690 --> 19:27.300
that he is the owner of Yuelai Restaurant.

19:29.360 --> 19:30.000
Yuelai Restaurant?

19:32.300 --> 19:32.650
Okay.

19:33.620 --> 19:34.870
I'll go to this restaurant.

19:35.500 --> 19:36.980
You stay here and keep investigating.

19:37.260 --> 19:37.700
Okay.

19:54.880 --> 19:55.620
See you next time.

19:56.880 --> 19:57.280
Take care.

19:58.870 --> 19:59.700
Boss is back.

20:01.430 --> 20:02.070
Sirs.

20:02.310 --> 20:03.220
I'm really sorry.

20:03.500 --> 20:04.420
The tables of our restaurant

20:04.480 --> 20:05.120
are hard to be available.

20:05.150 --> 20:06.220
We're fully booked today.

20:06.380 --> 20:07.090
Come here next time.

20:08.260 --> 20:11.060
I can write letters and petitions for you.

20:11.550 --> 20:12.670
Every ten words cost one coin.

20:20.240 --> 20:21.920
Make way.

20:22.900 --> 20:24.620
Make way.

20:33.140 --> 20:34.180
A basket of firethorns

20:34.210 --> 20:35.420
can only be exchanged for a few coins.

20:36.490 --> 20:37.660
If I want to earn 1,000 taels of gold,

20:38.850 --> 20:40.170
it'll take eight lifetimes.

20:41.790 --> 20:42.910
Okay. Thank you.

20:50.180 --> 20:53.270
[Write Letters for People, Every Ten Words Cost One Tael of Silver]

20:53.570 --> 20:54.850
Every ten words cost one teal of silver?

20:56.020 --> 20:57.500
It'd be strange if someone came.

21:02.500 --> 21:03.020
Sir.

21:03.700 --> 21:04.700
I want you

21:04.870 --> 21:06.190
to write a letter for me.

21:17.740 --> 21:19.360
Miss, it's done.

21:19.700 --> 21:20.140
Sir,

21:20.300 --> 21:21.250
don't just write it.

21:21.320 --> 21:22.080
Help me read it.

21:22.110 --> 21:23.060
See if there's something wrong.

21:23.140 --> 21:23.370
Yes.

21:23.370 --> 21:24.460
Read it.

21:24.480 --> 21:25.470
Read it.

21:25.510 --> 21:26.820
That costs extra.

21:27.830 --> 21:29.180
Can you read it now?

21:29.390 --> 21:29.950
Can you read it?

21:30.130 --> 21:30.700
Can you read it?

21:31.190 --> 21:31.710
It's not...

21:32.740 --> 21:33.620
Is it enough?

21:33.650 --> 21:34.470
Can you read it now?

21:34.500 --> 21:35.900
Read it.

21:35.920 --> 21:36.970
Yes, sir. Read it.

21:39.500 --> 21:40.140
Read it.

21:40.420 --> 21:42.420
Read it.

21:42.440 --> 21:44.010
Yes, just read it.

21:44.040 --> 21:44.760
Just read it.

21:44.790 --> 21:45.830
Clouds change in the sky.

21:46.110 --> 21:47.250
Shooting stars convey the sadness of lovesickness.

21:47.740 --> 21:49.210
I passed through the vast Milky Way quietly tonight.

21:49.810 --> 21:51.470
When we parted, I couldn't bear to look at the Magpie Bridge.

21:51.940 --> 21:53.880
If love between us can last forever,

21:54.460 --> 21:56.060
why do we need to stay together night and day?

21:56.140 --> 21:56.670
Shen Nuo.

21:56.700 --> 21:57.700
He read it so well.

21:58.120 --> 21:59.180
He's so talented.

21:59.820 --> 22:00.820
He read it so well.

22:00.840 --> 22:01.640
Yes.

22:02.570 --> 22:03.220
It's my turn.

22:03.370 --> 22:04.220
It's my turn.

22:04.350 --> 22:05.160
It's our turn.

22:05.190 --> 22:05.890
Don't push.

22:05.920 --> 22:06.360
Sir.

22:06.820 --> 22:07.660
Sir, who is she?

22:07.700 --> 22:08.460
Who is carrying a basket here?

22:08.460 --> 22:09.420
Just one sentence.

22:10.200 --> 22:11.850
You refused to make money with your face, didn't you?

22:13.860 --> 22:15.240
I just don't want to make money with you.

22:15.280 --> 22:16.220
I didn't say I wouldn't do it myself.

22:16.240 --> 22:17.710
But you're using my idea.

22:17.740 --> 22:18.570
I should have half of the money

22:19.060 --> 22:20.060
you make.

22:21.740 --> 22:22.860
Who is she?

22:22.990 --> 22:23.800
Miss,

22:25.130 --> 22:26.060
what do you want to write?

22:26.760 --> 22:27.890
I...

22:28.300 --> 22:28.990
I know.

22:29.260 --> 22:29.930
You want to write

22:30.420 --> 22:33.220
that I want to stay with you

22:33.630 --> 22:34.910
and go everywhere with you.

22:35.580 --> 22:38.840
I want to fly over the world and be with you forever.

22:39.040 --> 22:39.700
This paragraph is good.

22:39.840 --> 22:40.680
This paragraph is better.

22:40.870 --> 22:42.180
This paragraph is much better than what I wrote.

22:42.200 --> 22:42.700
Write it.

22:44.750 --> 22:46.050
Yes. You can also ask him to write this later.

22:47.610 --> 22:49.620
Settle them down.

22:49.740 --> 22:50.540
Don't let them stand in front of me.

22:52.180 --> 22:52.700
Girls,

22:52.780 --> 22:53.380
listen to me.

22:53.660 --> 22:55.300
Line up and come one by one.

22:55.440 --> 22:56.800
I promise that you all will get a turn.

22:57.490 --> 22:58.630
Really.

22:58.660 --> 22:59.260
Come on, line up.

22:59.280 --> 23:00.560
I came first.

22:59.420 --> 23:01.200
[Yuelai Restaurant]

23:03.060 --> 23:03.940
One by one.

23:03.980 --> 23:04.860
Move back a little.

23:04.980 --> 23:06.380
Move back a little.

23:06.730 --> 23:07.980
Move back a little, girls.

23:08.200 --> 23:09.610
Be careful. Don't be bumped into.

23:13.690 --> 23:14.170
Wait.

23:16.160 --> 23:17.000
I haven't finished yet.

23:19.560 --> 23:20.060
This

23:20.250 --> 23:21.570
is what you paid for your accommodations.

23:22.110 --> 23:22.660
This

23:22.690 --> 23:23.820
is what you paid for your daily meals.

23:23.890 --> 23:25.520
Your grandma didn't let me pay for meals.

23:28.530 --> 23:28.900
Fine.

23:30.870 --> 23:32.320
You're good at flattering people.

23:34.070 --> 23:34.660
This is what you paid

23:34.660 --> 23:35.500
for my mother's hairstick

23:35.580 --> 23:36.460
and the medical expenses

23:36.460 --> 23:37.060
Youheng paid for you.

23:43.980 --> 23:44.460
By the way,

23:45.050 --> 23:47.220
you don't like making money, do you?

23:47.390 --> 23:48.530
Why did you set up a stand all of a sudden?

23:52.220 --> 23:53.740
I met a person who's from my hometown two days ago.

23:54.210 --> 23:55.190
He was kept.

23:55.860 --> 23:57.320
He needs a ransom of 200 taels of silver.

23:57.850 --> 23:58.870
I need to save money for him.

23:58.900 --> 24:00.550
So I went to the town and wrote letters for people.

24:10.800 --> 24:11.710
Really?

24:16.210 --> 24:17.460
What reason are you thinking about?

24:24.300 --> 24:24.980
You are

24:25.000 --> 24:26.200
a good friend.

24:27.380 --> 24:29.250
Alright, we've divided the money.

24:31.920 --> 24:33.640
For the sake of your friend who's from your hometown.

25:16.540 --> 25:17.180
Man'er.

25:18.450 --> 25:19.660
Where did you get this hairstick?

25:21.250 --> 25:22.820
I used the money I made by selling firethorns

25:23.180 --> 25:23.940
to buy it for you.

25:26.820 --> 25:28.010
You're really capable.

25:28.780 --> 25:30.130
But there are many insects and snakes on the mountain.

25:30.360 --> 25:31.600
Don't go there next time.

25:32.660 --> 25:34.690
You gave your own hairstick

25:34.720 --> 25:35.530
to Grandma.

25:36.500 --> 25:37.420
But it's okay.

25:37.980 --> 25:39.240
In the future, I'll make money

25:39.780 --> 25:42.260
and buy you hairsticks which are set with gold, silver,

25:42.860 --> 25:43.620
and agate.

25:44.500 --> 25:45.740
Although this one

25:46.950 --> 25:47.950
looks plain,

25:48.400 --> 25:50.400
you'll look good in it.

25:51.570 --> 25:52.260
Not now.

25:53.280 --> 25:54.850
I'm afraid it'll cause trouble if your grandma sees it.

25:55.980 --> 25:57.860
I'll keep it. I'll wear it in the future.

25:59.800 --> 26:00.620
I like it.

26:04.830 --> 26:06.280
I just washed the dates.

26:06.600 --> 26:07.130
Try one.

26:09.780 --> 26:10.220
Is it sweet?

26:13.220 --> 26:13.660
It's delicious.

26:15.050 --> 26:15.780
Mom, have one too.

26:16.900 --> 26:17.260
Okay.

26:17.450 --> 26:18.460
You eat.

26:28.580 --> 26:29.550
What's wrong?

26:30.050 --> 26:31.130
You look serious.

26:31.470 --> 26:32.980
I saw Lian Man'er just now.

26:34.110 --> 26:35.590
She had a money pouch in her hand.

26:36.380 --> 26:38.060
The money pouch was full.

26:39.020 --> 26:39.500
Mother.

26:40.250 --> 26:41.680
Where did she get the money?

26:44.530 --> 26:46.420
I saw her give Aunt Zhang

26:46.640 --> 26:48.090
a new hairstick.

26:48.740 --> 26:50.140
Judging by the style of the hairstick,

26:50.390 --> 26:51.630
it costed at least one tael of silver.

26:52.220 --> 26:53.190
Really?

26:53.300 --> 26:53.710
Mother.

26:54.230 --> 26:55.120
Every year, Grandma

26:55.150 --> 26:56.670
can only save a little money.

26:57.900 --> 26:59.540
If my uncles

26:59.660 --> 27:00.220
take it,

27:00.220 --> 27:01.660
it'll be a great loss to us.

27:04.290 --> 27:05.060
I'll go

27:05.060 --> 27:06.220
and ask your Aunt Zhang

27:07.020 --> 27:07.900
what Lian Man'er

27:08.510 --> 27:09.640
is doing.

27:13.020 --> 27:13.700
By the way, Mother,

27:14.180 --> 27:14.980
have you taken your medicine?

27:15.780 --> 27:16.700
You'll definitely give me

27:16.720 --> 27:17.650
a younger brother

27:18.100 --> 27:19.780
and make Aunt He shut her mouth.

27:35.940 --> 27:36.620
Good morning, Nuo.

27:37.220 --> 27:38.460
The early bird gets the worm.

27:38.700 --> 27:39.210
Let's go and set up a stand.

27:41.020 --> 27:44.430
You and I are so close.

27:44.460 --> 27:45.420
We fly together.

27:46.060 --> 27:47.380
We'll fly over the world

27:47.660 --> 27:49.220
and be with each other forever.

27:49.780 --> 27:51.460
The industry value chain was formed so quickly.

27:52.260 --> 27:53.940
Who said the early bird

27:53.940 --> 27:54.740
gets the worm?

27:55.460 --> 27:55.980
I think

27:56.460 --> 27:57.220
that the early bird

27:57.220 --> 27:58.220
was eaten by the worm.

28:02.260 --> 28:04.020
These girls' affection

28:04.020 --> 28:05.460
changed too fast.

28:06.650 --> 28:08.180
I understand.

28:09.510 --> 28:10.930
But they chose these guys.

28:16.480 --> 28:17.760
Look at their faces.

28:20.560 --> 28:22.470
Good business is also a problem.

28:30.530 --> 28:31.380
What do you mean?

28:33.060 --> 28:34.500
You gave them two coins, but you gave me one.

28:35.050 --> 28:42.990
[Yuelai Restaurant]

28:47.620 --> 28:48.220
Little beggar.

28:48.580 --> 28:50.050
Do you want to go to Yuelai Restaurant for a meal?

28:51.460 --> 28:52.150
You have money?

28:53.220 --> 28:53.860
Just follow me.

28:54.340 --> 28:54.810
Let's go.

28:56.040 --> 28:57.380
This way, please.

29:02.130 --> 29:02.560
Please have a seat.

29:04.740 --> 29:06.220
What would you like to eat?

29:07.380 --> 29:07.950
Take a look.

29:11.100 --> 29:12.430
Order whatever you want.

29:12.580 --> 29:13.160
Don't save money for me.

29:13.530 --> 29:14.220
I'll be right back.

29:14.300 --> 29:15.320
You grew a conscience?

29:15.630 --> 29:16.590
I'll order what I want then.

29:17.750 --> 29:18.380
Miss,

29:18.480 --> 29:19.670
let me tell you the names of the dishes.

29:19.780 --> 29:21.080
Our specialties

29:21.160 --> 29:23.080
are steamed lamb, steamed bear paw, steamed deer tail,

29:23.180 --> 29:24.510
roasted duck, roasted chicken, roasted goose,

29:24.580 --> 29:25.830
braised pork, braised duck, braised chicken, bacon,

29:25.860 --> 29:26.300
Songhua pork belly,

29:26.300 --> 29:26.860
dried sausages,

29:26.890 --> 29:27.910
meat platters, smoked chicken,

29:27.940 --> 29:28.850
steamed eight treasures with pork,

29:28.890 --> 29:29.970
and brewed duck with rice.

29:35.730 --> 29:36.290
Young Master Song.

29:36.740 --> 29:37.660
Tomorrow is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

29:37.830 --> 29:39.270
I specially prepared some gifts

29:39.290 --> 29:40.100
for you.

29:44.530 --> 29:45.420
This batch of goods.

29:45.780 --> 29:46.730
Young Master Song.

29:46.670 --> 29:48.850
[The Eldest Son of the Song Family, Song Haikun]

29:46.730 --> 29:47.780
Can you give me 10% more?

29:48.330 --> 29:49.650
It's not easy for you to deliver goods.

29:51.740 --> 29:52.500
You mean

29:52.600 --> 29:53.890
I treated you badly before?

29:55.150 --> 29:55.900
Young Master Song.

29:56.220 --> 29:57.540
What are you talking about?

29:58.180 --> 29:58.930
I dare not.

30:09.040 --> 30:10.140
I'll ask someone

30:10.250 --> 30:11.340
to get you a new pot of tea.

30:23.150 --> 30:24.630
I came here in advance

30:24.660 --> 30:25.770
and checked here.

30:25.970 --> 30:27.340
They're just ordinary customers.

30:27.630 --> 30:28.500
Boss Fan

30:28.600 --> 30:30.090
needs your help.

30:30.660 --> 30:32.220
Even if you give him guts,

30:32.540 --> 30:33.700
he doesn't dare

30:33.900 --> 30:34.770
to fish for information about you.

30:36.580 --> 30:37.640
This idot.

30:38.720 --> 30:39.730
I heard the news yesterday.

30:39.990 --> 30:40.960
Boss Qian

30:41.430 --> 30:43.020
said my delivery was unfair behind my back.

30:44.550 --> 30:45.590
Today, the person downstairs

30:45.920 --> 30:47.100
came here to annoy me.

30:48.260 --> 30:49.220
What a bad day.

30:52.300 --> 30:53.940
In July and August,

30:53.940 --> 30:55.330
we already gave half of the goods

30:55.350 --> 30:56.950
to them.

30:57.780 --> 30:59.260
We can only take the rest.

30:59.930 --> 31:01.670
These people

31:01.700 --> 31:03.220
are hypocritical and greedy.

31:04.620 --> 31:05.980
They know clearly

31:06.220 --> 31:07.340
how much they can get.

31:07.540 --> 31:09.130
We have to

31:09.150 --> 31:10.220
make it clear.

31:11.500 --> 31:12.460
Don't worry.

31:12.740 --> 31:14.020
The time and amount

31:14.040 --> 31:14.750
of each delivery

31:15.170 --> 31:16.630
are recorded clearly

31:16.670 --> 31:18.350
in this registration book.

31:19.220 --> 31:20.620
Those bosses

31:20.700 --> 31:22.010
have also signed and stamped

31:22.040 --> 31:23.720
this registration book.

31:24.150 --> 31:25.920
If we are asked about it,

31:26.390 --> 31:28.340
they can't deny it.

31:30.560 --> 31:31.110
OK.

31:32.780 --> 31:33.950
How are the arrangements

31:33.980 --> 31:34.790
for the next shipment?

31:35.540 --> 31:36.640
Young Master, don't worry.

31:36.680 --> 31:38.240
Everything is arranged.

31:43.180 --> 31:44.140
Let's order together.

31:51.220 --> 31:51.860
Which Song family

31:51.860 --> 31:53.220
Lian Hua'er is marring into?

31:56.300 --> 31:56.940
That Song family.

31:57.970 --> 31:58.540
Which one?

31:59.460 --> 31:59.980
That one.

32:02.410 --> 32:03.900
The one who has many restaurants and private banks

32:03.940 --> 32:04.700
in the town?

32:04.840 --> 32:05.420
Yes.

32:06.120 --> 32:07.210
You know it clearly.

32:08.350 --> 32:09.340
Is there another Song family

32:09.370 --> 32:10.460
that is as rich as this one?

32:13.060 --> 32:13.700
Which son of the Song family

32:13.700 --> 32:14.940
she's marring?

32:15.980 --> 32:17.570
I don't know. I don't care.

32:18.470 --> 32:19.510
Why do you ask so many questions?

32:21.860 --> 32:23.870
I'm just asking.

32:25.330 --> 32:26.380
You're quite nosy.

32:30.650 --> 32:31.130
Let's go.

32:31.540 --> 32:32.290
I haven't eaten yet.

32:33.220 --> 32:33.900
Do you have money?

32:34.540 --> 32:35.460
Aren't you treating me?

32:37.650 --> 32:38.500
When did I say

32:38.500 --> 32:39.410
I would treat you?

32:39.650 --> 32:40.800
I just want to show you

32:41.080 --> 32:42.190
the most profitable restaurant

32:42.240 --> 32:43.170
and broaden your horizons.

32:43.790 --> 32:44.620
Let's go.

32:44.800 --> 32:45.930
When the food is served,

32:46.070 --> 32:47.090
you have to pay.

32:53.460 --> 32:54.300
I was fooled.

32:59.740 --> 33:02.260
Send this to that person.

33:03.010 --> 33:03.600
Grandpa. Grandma.

33:04.480 --> 33:06.080
Man'er, you came back just in time.

33:06.360 --> 33:08.040
Tomorrow is the Mid-Autumn Festival.

33:08.560 --> 33:10.110
Send some mooncakes

33:10.140 --> 33:11.300
to Mr. Jin later

33:11.500 --> 33:12.510
and tell him

33:12.820 --> 33:14.220
not to worry about the money

33:14.220 --> 33:15.380
we owe him.

33:15.580 --> 33:17.290
The Lian family will repay it on time.

33:18.610 --> 33:19.240
It's better

33:19.320 --> 33:20.670
to ask Uncle Shouren to do this.

33:21.930 --> 33:23.910
If your uncle goes there and gives the gifts,

33:23.940 --> 33:24.420
he'll think

33:24.420 --> 33:25.980
that we have something urgent to ask.

33:26.330 --> 33:27.190
It's not good.

33:27.730 --> 33:29.620
It's better to ask youngsters to go.

33:30.030 --> 33:30.720
Go.

33:32.540 --> 33:33.380
-Go.
-Fine.

33:42.310 --> 33:42.980
They're all here.

33:43.490 --> 33:44.600
Take whatever you want.

33:44.890 --> 33:46.250
Help yourself.

33:46.830 --> 33:48.130
Make yourself at home.

33:48.990 --> 33:49.980
If I were at home,

33:50.410 --> 33:51.500
I couldn't take

33:51.520 --> 33:52.400
whatever I want.

33:54.800 --> 33:55.910
Why don't I see

33:55.930 --> 33:56.650
Youheng?

33:57.270 --> 33:58.420
He went to collect the debts from Mr. Wu

33:58.420 --> 33:59.020
in the west of the village.

33:59.120 --> 34:00.240
He'll be back soon.

34:01.020 --> 34:01.500
He

34:01.840 --> 34:02.500
went to collect debts?

34:02.520 --> 34:02.980
Yes.

34:03.910 --> 34:04.700
I have to go and take a look.

34:04.900 --> 34:05.460
Go.

34:09.380 --> 34:10.340
Here, take more.

34:10.580 --> 34:11.850
Man'er. Man'er.

34:26.000 --> 34:26.310
Here.

34:26.590 --> 34:27.310
Sweep here well.

34:33.350 --> 34:35.000
Clear the firewood away.

34:41.409 --> 34:42.659
Clean this table.

34:48.780 --> 34:51.230
My life is so hard.

34:51.820 --> 34:52.460
I can't

34:52.989 --> 34:54.260
pay off my debts

34:54.290 --> 34:55.190
for now.

34:56.230 --> 34:57.640
How should I spend

34:58.460 --> 34:59.980
the rest of my life?

35:02.790 --> 35:03.300
Yes.

35:04.480 --> 35:06.920
Your life is indeed hard.

35:10.320 --> 35:10.900
Youheng.

35:12.040 --> 35:12.510
Man'er.

35:13.130 --> 35:13.980
Why are you here?

35:14.660 --> 35:15.110
Wait a moment.

35:15.220 --> 35:16.190
The water for washing the chickens is dirty.

35:16.470 --> 35:17.380
I'll go and change it first.

35:46.630 --> 35:48.310
I helped you and took these.

35:49.190 --> 35:49.940
That's not too much, right?

35:50.940 --> 35:52.020
This...

35:52.050 --> 35:52.540
Remember,

35:53.340 --> 35:54.230
you're a debt collector,

35:54.260 --> 35:55.020
not a debtor.

35:55.400 --> 35:56.930
You're such a pushover.

35:57.840 --> 35:58.240
Also,

35:58.680 --> 35:59.340
if you meet people

35:59.340 --> 36:00.580
who you can't deal with again in the future,

36:00.760 --> 36:01.430
remember to take me with you.

36:01.630 --> 36:02.400
I have plenty of ways

36:03.320 --> 36:04.230
to deal with such people.

36:04.840 --> 36:05.330
Man'er.

36:07.050 --> 36:07.980
I don't know

36:08.710 --> 36:10.190
if I should say it.

36:10.630 --> 36:11.340
You're welcome.

36:14.060 --> 36:14.500
No.

36:15.950 --> 36:18.040
Well, I should thank you.

36:19.460 --> 36:19.980
But

36:20.330 --> 36:21.850
this family is in a tight spot.

36:22.900 --> 36:23.870
The old lady of the family

36:24.240 --> 36:25.190
is dying.

36:26.280 --> 36:27.380
They're killing chickens

36:27.410 --> 36:28.360
and geese,

36:28.670 --> 36:30.470
because the Mid-Autumn Festival is coming.

36:31.200 --> 36:32.790
They want the old lady to remember it.

36:33.320 --> 36:34.770
The cattle and the sheep in the yard

36:36.710 --> 36:37.580
were all borrowed.

36:39.360 --> 36:39.870
They want

36:40.190 --> 36:40.790
to make the old lady

36:40.830 --> 36:41.780
be relieved when she dies.

36:43.180 --> 36:44.190
I guess

36:45.100 --> 36:45.700
the money you collected

36:47.070 --> 36:48.150
was for the old lady's

36:48.180 --> 36:48.950
coffin.

36:52.870 --> 36:53.460
Enough.

36:56.330 --> 36:57.130
When you were collecting debts,

36:57.150 --> 36:58.590
you were not eloquent.

37:06.930 --> 37:08.080
I failed to make money

37:08.430 --> 37:09.440
and even lost ten coins.

37:09.830 --> 37:11.620
Man'er, you're so kind.

37:11.920 --> 37:12.410
Stay away from me

37:12.430 --> 37:13.270
when you collect debts in the future.

37:13.530 --> 37:14.700
I want to invite you to the group dance tomorrow.

37:14.910 --> 37:15.670
Let's go together.

37:15.780 --> 37:16.680
I'm not going.

37:16.910 --> 37:18.420
I need to make more money.

37:18.700 --> 37:19.500
Just one day.

37:35.420 --> 37:37.260
Timely wind and rain.

37:37.650 --> 37:40.060
A good harvest.

37:42.940 --> 37:44.940
Timely wind and rain.

37:45.340 --> 37:47.460
A good harvest.

38:30.600 --> 38:31.650
Youheng, sorry to keep you waiting.

38:31.890 --> 38:33.000
I've only been here for a while.

38:35.140 --> 38:35.780
I didn't expect

38:35.880 --> 38:37.150
that you're also interested in this.

38:37.540 --> 38:38.460
Folk dances.

38:39.050 --> 38:39.820
They're ordinary.

38:41.650 --> 38:42.260
Youheng.

38:42.590 --> 38:44.100
Why are the people participating in the Mid-Autumn Festival group dance

38:44.140 --> 38:45.900
all young people?

38:46.350 --> 38:47.690
Many couples in the village

38:48.210 --> 38:49.760
knew each other in the group dance.

38:51.310 --> 38:52.300
I see.

38:53.940 --> 38:55.580
Although it looks like square dancing,

38:55.740 --> 38:56.660
it's quite interesting.

38:57.470 --> 38:58.190
Square dancing?

39:01.030 --> 39:02.710
It's a kind of dance performed on this kind of ground.

39:12.260 --> 39:14.330
Come on. Are you ready?

39:32.350 --> 39:32.880
Man'er.

39:39.470 --> 39:41.770
I'll show you my talents.

39:43.740 --> 39:44.180
Together?

39:48.300 --> 39:49.900
I guess Shen is not good at dancing.

39:50.140 --> 39:50.900
Don't make things difficult for him.

39:51.000 --> 39:51.610
Let's go.

40:45.020 --> 40:45.930
I thought you weren't coming.

40:46.980 --> 40:47.910
It's better than doing nothing.

41:30.620 --> 41:31.540
No matter what you want

41:31.540 --> 41:32.260
from Man'er,

41:32.430 --> 41:34.180
leave when you're done.

41:36.140 --> 41:37.350
Youheng, you really care

41:37.370 --> 41:38.370
about Lian Man'er.

41:40.260 --> 41:41.570
Just remember what I said.

41:46.410 --> 41:47.490
What if I don't leave?

41:56.170 --> 42:01.640
[Mission: 1,000 taels of gold]

41:56.170 --> 42:01.640
[Income: firethorns and letters, 23 taels of silver and 66 coins]

41:56.170 --> 42:01.640
[Expenses: a hairstick for Mom and the money for the debtor, 1 tael of silver and 10 coins]
